From a456932e33288ec95d12e081413deb0fe9fa4e48 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 08:14:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Multi-location Phase B (rebuilt): weekend + card surcharges

Rebuilt onto the current codebase (the original Phase B patch no longer applied
after this week's Locations-tab changes). Same behaviour:

- Weekend surcharge: a % on chosen days (Sat/Sun default) + listed public-holiday
  dates, on the item subtotal.
- Card surcharge: a % on card payments only (app card + POS card tender; never
  cash or gift balance), on the total. Comps are exempt.

Applied server-side as Square service_charges (server/lib/surcharges.js) so they
show on the receipt and reconcile in Square; the client only estimates a line for
transparency. Admin -> Locations gains a Surcharges card; checkout shows the
estimated line and the Pay button reflects it; the POS card tender notes the %.
